lity.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A step-by-step timeline from R&amp;D to final shipping.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Protect your budget and partner with a manufacturer you can trust. Let&#8217;s build your brand together.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you are planning to launch a new shampoo brand or scale an existing hair care line, you have likely hit a frustrating roadblock: no one wants to talk about exact pricing. In the OEM\/ODM manufacturing world, pricing is often treated as a closely guarded secret. At The Shampoo Factory, we believe that transparency is [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3215,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4449","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"blocksy_meta":{"styles_descriptor":{"styles":{"desktop":"","tablet":"","mobile":""},"google_fonts":[],"version":8}},"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v28.3 (Yoast SEO v28.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>The Hidden Costs of Starting a Hair Care Line: A Transparent Guide to Private Label Pricing - Guangdong Shampoo Factory<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"If you are planning to launch a new shampoo brand or scale an existing hair care line, you have likely hit a frustrating roadblock: no one wants to talk about exact pricing. In the OEM\/ODM manufacturing world, pricing is often treated as a closely guarded secret. At The Shampoo Factory,\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/the-hidden-costs-of-starting-a-h